      "text": "Answering the call.\n\nWatch as a @USCG aircrew hoists four people from a 42-foot yacht disabled by 12-foot waves off the Long Island coast. No injuries were reported after the rescue Saturday near Moriches Inlet, New York.\n\nA successful rescue in challenging conditions that showcases the readiness and expertise of our aircrews.\n\nIn surf or storm, we’re Always Ready to respond and fulfill our sacred trust – so others may live.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/7xNQj7f6mv\n\n#SemperParatus #SoOthersMayLive\n@USCGNortheast @USCGLANTAREA",
